+
+/* Snapshot state (v0.89): the full SDIO-card surface — host regfile
+ * (STAT/IFLG/IMASK/DMAC...), the staged RES byte window, the CCCR/FBR
+ * space + CIS chains, the fn1/fn2 windows, the staged CMD53 data phase,
